  "body": "Found here: https://github.com/vector-im/riot-web/issues/7764#issuecomment-443447349\r\n\r\nNot sure what the best solution is but apparently either some people don't realize or don't care but it's a pretty bad experience when the first thing you see after registering is \"Server may be unavailable, overloaded, or you hit a bug.\"\r\n\r\nYou probably shouldn't be allowed to set welcomeUserId to a user on another server if you don't federate.\r\n\r\n![screen shot 2018-12-01 at 9 19 51 pm](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5855073/49335206-d9ae6600-f5ae-11e8-816f-b5c4ea9b0c06.png)\r\n\r\n![screen shot 2018-12-01 at 9 15 59 pm](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5855073/49335180-4d9c3e80-f5ae-11e8-861e-ba46922229a2.png)",
